      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "Hi, I'm Álvaro Calvo, a technical designer with over three years of experience working with Unreal Engine 5 and Unity.\nIn those three years, I've designed from scratch, prototyped, and iterated on everything from movement and combat mechanics to enemies and AI.\nI also create in-engine tools to streamline the workflow for my fellow designers and myself. I also create levels, combat arenas and puzzles as well as design and implement world dynamics, systems and interactions.",
